      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "No? You must be new here. Alright, well out on the Wildlands are a bunch of Kath Hounds who were imported from off-world. One too many got loose and now their populations are swelling. Bad for trade but good for us.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
