      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Their teeth and furs are useful in weapons and armor production, but also for making clothes and blankets. We are always in need of more blankets for the refugees.\n\nI'll need five of each. Are you up to the task?",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
